flowchart TB
    A[Compile Time] --> B{Library Type?}
    B -->|Static .a| C[Copy code into executable]
    B -->|Shared .so| D[Store reference only]
    
    C --> E[Large executable, No runtime dependency]
    D --> F[Small executable]
    
    F --> G[Runtime]
    G --> H[Dynamic Linker ld.so]
    H --> I{Find library?}
    I -->|Found| J[Load & link .so]
    I -->|Not Found| K[Error: cannot open, shared object file]
    
    J --> L[Program runs]
    K --> M[Program fails]
    
    style E fill:#ffccbc
    style L fill:#c8e6c9
    style M fill:#ef9a9a
